{"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemails:"]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"text":"void","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmails:","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"emails"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}],"languages":["occ"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Array of email address strings. Each must be a valid email format."}]}],"name":"emails"}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates multiple email addresses with the current device for omnichannel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"email campaigns. This is useful when users have multiple email addresses"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"(work, personal, etc.) and want to receive communications on all of them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All provided emails will be linked to the same device and user ID,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enabling unified targeting across all addresses.","type":"text"}]},{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Register multiple emails from user profile:","type":"text"}]},{"syntax":"swift","code":["class UserProfileManager {","","    func syncEmailsFromProfile(_ profile: UserProfile) {","        var emails: [String] = []","","        if let primary = profile.primaryEmail {","            emails.append(primary)","        }","        if let secondary = profile.secondaryEmail {","            emails.append(secondary)","        }","        if let work = profile.workEmail {","            emails.append(work)","        }","","        guard !emails.isEmpty else { return }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setEmails(emails)","","        \/\/ Update tags with email count","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"email_count\": emails.count,","            \"has_work_email\": profile.workEmail != nil,","            \"has_multiple_emails\": emails.count > 1","        ])","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"}]}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmails:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Type Method","externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setEmails:","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmails:","kind":"identifier"}],"fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmails:"}],"title":"setEmails:"},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers multiple email addresses associated with the current user."}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setEmails:":{"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemails:","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmails:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Registers multiple email addresses associated with the current user.","type":"text"}],"title":"setEmails:","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmails:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmails:","kind":"